{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年94歲的「修哥」胡楓日前獲頒「世界傑出華人終身成就獎」，圈中一眾好友紛紛為他慶祝，並感到高興。</p><p>張文慈（Pinky）昨日（12日）於社交平台分享多張出席慶祝晚宴的合照，包括龔慈恩、羅霖、譚玉瑛等，齊齊祝賀胡楓奪得殊榮。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:16:15.059923+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T02:26:07+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:31.306995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:09:31.306995+00:00","content_hash":"a975c1cc549e5799fa976bc2ad8abb48dd055d99cfcbfcc69fe99bf424903244","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}